pliteal PTA with stent placement</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Stenosis</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.0</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Beta</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.96, 1.0</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="pone.0003883-Muradin1">&#x0005b;24&#x0005d;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Occlusion</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.99</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Beta</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.95, 1.0</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="pone.0003883-Muradin1">&#x0005b;24&#x0005d;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Aortic bifurcation grafts</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.98</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Beta</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.96, 0.9</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="pone.0003883-Gentile1">&#x0005b;25&#x0005d;</xref></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" align="left" rowspan="1">Femoro-popliteal or femoroinfrapopliteal bypass</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Autologous vein above-knee anastomosis</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.95</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Beta</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.86, 0.99</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="pone.0003883-Green1">&#x0005b;26&#x0005d;</xref>, <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="pone.0003883-Johnson1">&#x0005b;27&#x0005d;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Autologous vein below-knee anastomosis</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.94</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Beta</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.85, 0.99</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="pone.0003883-Albers1">&#x0005b;28&#x0005d;</xref></td><